  "question": {
    "text": "If $\\mathrm{f}: \\mathrm{R} \\rightarrow \\mathrm{R}$ is a function defined by $f(x)=[\\mathrm{x}] \\cos \\left(\\frac{2 x-1}{2}\\right) \\pi$, where $[\\mathrm{x}]$ denotes the greatest integer function, then $f$ is",
